1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,740
kW at kWh… pareho
lang ba 'yan?

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,960
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:12,060
Ang kW ay power: gaano
kabilis gumamit ng kuryente.

4
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:17,380
Ang kWh ay energy: gaano
karami ang nagamit.

5
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:21,410
Halimbawa, isang
100-watt na TV.

6
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,430
Kapag binuksan
mo nang 10 oras,

7
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,670
1 kWh ang nagamit nito.

8
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:31,180
Sa Meralco bill, kWh ang
basehan ng energy charges.

9
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:37,210
Kaya bago mag-solar,
kilalanin pareho: kW at kWh.

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:43,100
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,630
Life is SoLight with Solar.
